  "question": {
    "text": "The temperature of an ideal gas is increased from $120 \\mathrm{~K}$ to $480 \\mathrm{~K}$. If at $120 \\mathrm{~K}$, the root mean square velocity of the gas molecules is $v$, at $480 \\mathrm{~K}$ it becomes",
